WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.101
The Ajanta caves were carved

2
00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:04.263
into a horseshoe-shaped cliff.

3
00:00:04.263 --> 00:00:06.456
Over several centuries.

4
00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:08.489
The early caves date from

5
00:00:08.489 --> 00:00:10.739
around the second century BCE.

6
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:11.828
The later ones,

7
00:00:11.828 --> 00:00:13.604
from the fifth century CE,

8
00:00:13.604 --> 00:00:15.388
under the Vakatakas.

9
00:00:15.736 --> 00:00:17.930
Prayer halls and monasteries,

10
00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.835
with murals of Jataka stories.

11
00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:24.076
Ajanta became a World Heritage

12
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:25.884
Site in 1983,

13
00:00:25.884 --> 00:00:28.178
along with nearby Ellora.

14
00:00:28.517 --> 00:00:29.743
Your turn.

15
00:00:29.743 --> 00:00:31.727
What do the murals show?
